  "releaseNotes": "_Fixed_\n- ID3v2 : Fix unreadable tag when there's a garbage byte right after the ID3v2 block at the end of the file\n- ID3v2 : Properly read the **Year (Recording year)** field when it contains Arabic or Farsi digits\n- WAV : Properly handle illegal ID3v2 tag at the beginning of the file\n- MP4/M4A : Properly detect the `moov` atom when it is located behind more than 100 `mdat` atoms\n***Binaries are available from nuGet***",
